257
00:18:02,299 --> 00:18:05,299
Therefore, it is recommended to make larger plates.

258
00:18:05,299 --> 00:18:08,299
Finally, reduce the particle diameter of the clothing.

259
00:18:10,299 --> 00:18:12,299
The thickness of the plate.

260
00:18:12,299 --> 00:18:13,299
Conflict.

261
00:18:13,299 --> 00:18:16,299
It is intended to prevent the surface from protruding during the simulation process.

262
00:18:16,299 --> 00:18:19,299
